<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it initiated coverage of Cascade Corp as outperform.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.55 per share for 1997, and $1.75 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 15-1/4 on Monday.</p>
</text>
